
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>서류 피드백 - 면접 시뮬레이터</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <script>
        tailwind.config = {
            theme: {
                extend: {
                    colors: {
                        'pink-400': '#f472b6',
                        'pink-500': '#ec4899',
                        'pink-600': '#db2777'
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/page.css">
</head>
<body class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50">
<!-- Header -->
<header class="bg-white shadow-sm">
    <nav class="container mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
        <div class="flex items-center space-x-3">
            <div class="w-10 h-10 gradient-icon rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9.663 17h4.673M12 3v1m6.364 1.636l-.707.707M21 12h-1M4 12H3m3.343-5.657l-.707-.707m2.828 9.9a5 5 0 117.072 0l-.548.547A3.374 3.374 0 0014 18.469V19a2 2 0 11-4 0v-.531c0-.895-.356-1.754-.988-2.386l-.548-.547z"></path>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <span class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800">면접 시뮬레이터</span>
        </div>

        <a href="/selection" class="text-gray-600 hover:text-gray-800 transition-colors flex items-center space-x-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"></path>
            </svg>
            <span>뒤로 가기</span>
        </a>
    </nav>
</header>

<!-- Main Content -->
<main class="container mx-auto px-6 py-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-12 fade-in">
        <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-400 to-pink-600 rounded-3xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"></path>
            </svg>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">
            AI 서류 피드백
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
            이력서와 자기소개서를 업로드하면 AI가 전문적인 분석과 개선 방안을 제공합니다
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <!-- 업로드 섹션 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-lg mb-8 fade-in">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">서류 업로드</h2>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                <!-- 이력서 업로드 -->
                <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-pink-300 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:border-pink-400 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-pink-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-pink-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M7 21h10a2 2 0 002-2V9.414a1 1 0 00-.293-.707l-5.414-5.414A1 1 0 0012.586 3H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14a2 2 0 002 2z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">이력서</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">PDF, DOC, DOCX 파일을 업로드해주세요</p>
                    <input type="file" id="resume" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx" class="hidden">
                    <label for="resume" class="bg-pink-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-pink-600 transition-colors cursor-pointer inline-block">
                        파일 선택
                    </label>
                </div>

                <!-- 자기소개서 업로드 -->
                <div class="border-2 border-dashed border-pink-300 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center hover:border-pink-400 transition-colors">
                    <div class="w-16 h-16 bg-pink-100 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                        <svg class="w-8 h-8 text-pink-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15.232 5.232l3.536 3.536m-2.036-5.036a2.5 2.5 0 113.536 3.536L6.5 21.036H3v-3.572L16.732 3.732z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">자기소개서</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 mb-4">PDF, DOC, DOCX 파일을 업로드해주세요</p>
                    <input type="file" id="coverletter" accept=".pdf,.doc,.docx" class="hidden">
                    <label for="coverletter" class="bg-pink-500 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-xl hover:bg-pink-600 transition-colors cursor-pointer inline-block">
                        파일 선택
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 분석 옵션 -->
        <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-lg mb-8 fade-in-delay">
            <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6">분석 옵션</h2>

            <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                <div class="bg-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h8a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2h-2M9 5a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2M9 5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">기본 분석</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">구조, 내용, 문법 검토</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">심화 분석</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">키워드 최적화, 경쟁력 분석</p>
                </div>

                <div class="bg-pink-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                    <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-pink-500 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-3">
                        <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-white" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-5 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"></path>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2">업계별 분석</h3>
                    <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm">업계 특성에 맞춘 맞춤 분석</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 분석 시작 버튼 -->
        <div class="text-center fade-in-delay-2">
            <button class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-500 to-pink-600 text-white px-12 py-4 rounded-2xl text-lg font-semibold hover:from-pink-600 hover:to-pink-700 transition-all transform hover:scale-105 shadow-lg">
                AI 분석 시작하기
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 inline-block ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 7l5 5m0 0l-5 5m5-5H6"></path>
                </svg>
            </button>
        </div>
    </div>
</main>

<script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
